Description: Modern media center (WebKitGTK client)
 Stremio is a modern media center for online video content.
 Features local and streaming content, subtitle management,
 and an extensible addon system.
 .
 This is the GTK4/libadwaita/WebKitGTK6 version, replacing the
 CEF-based renderer used before upstream release 1.0.0.
